    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82899caaafcb3a0849682d19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，欢迎回来～\n来吧来吧。来我旁边坐下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f95ef5a07b2774f457fbb41518a6f36cfceaabaa1a32d9b0dcaf583483e4ece",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1074/storytimeline_041074007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413c77648b9c607dbdfb7dd0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还有其他该做的事……我嘴里一边抗议一边乖乖坐下。\n此时，目白光明静静地笑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7ab47a8f84cab9ce4eab2fab60861b2ff6f15bb800595c2278e7ebf1ef55b39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
