      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "别那么说嘛，你才刚回来吧。\n今天我有好多事想跟你说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "134b4c1975916ae084b6a443a1deb537f4d768e8d1e148eb42c44819f3ceb973",
