      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知不觉间，我的身体已经疲惫不堪。\n她悠闲的声音，抚慰了我的全身。",
      "source_fingerprint": "003ea5ddd5ada373a0c74793a055468a7ca58eb0697d765c4b642181306d3cce",
