    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66987b1103fff87d46866921",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是没有这段“悠闲”的休息时光，恐怕我会把自己\n弄得精疲力尽，结果仍旧无法陪她去祭典吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd83321ddadb4087b03e126ace58b929531e6bd5543796f63b0cb87971dd9982",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
